{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":17478,\"date\":\"2026-09-05T11:53:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-05T09:53:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-ultra-iphone-18-pro-anteprima-evento-9-settembre-2026\",\"title\":\"iPhone Ultra e iPhone 18 Pro: anteprima dell’evento Apple del 9 settembre\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple terrà l’evento “Surprise and Shine” mercoledì 9 settembre alle 10:00 (PT). Attesi iPhone Ultra pieghevole, iPhone 18 Pro con nuove fotocamere e aggiornamenti su Watch e AirPods.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/Everything-Apple-Is-Expected-to-Announce-At-Surprise-and-Shine-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Everything-Apple-Is-Expected-to-Announce-At-Surprise-and-Shine-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17263,\"date\":\"2026-08-29T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-29T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-event-9-settembre-sei-prodotti-piu-attesi\",\"title\":\"Apple Event del 9 settembre: i sei prodotti più attesi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple terrà un evento il 9 settembre alle 10:00 (PT). Ecco i sei prodotti più probabili: iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max, il primo iPhone pieghevole, Apple Watch Series 12 e Ultra 4, e AirPods 5.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Apple-Surprise-Shine-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Surprise-Shine\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17261,\"date\":\"2026-08-29T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-29T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"tim-cook-lascia-la-guida-di-apple-le-frasi-chiave-dei-suoi-15-anni\",\"title\":\"Tim Cook lascia la guida di Apple: le frasi chiave dei suoi 15 anni\",\"excerpt\":